{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 20,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Do Not Sue the Brethren"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Dare any of you, having a matter against another, go to law before the unrighteous, and not before the saints? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that the saints will judge the world? And if the world will be judged by you, are you unworthy to judge the smallest matters? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that we shall judge angels? How much more, things that pertain to this life? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If then you have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "courts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "judgments concerning things pertaining to this life, do you appoint those who are least esteemed by the church to judge? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I say this to your shame. Is it so, that there is not a wise man among you, not even one, who will be able to judge between his brethren? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But brother goes to law against brother, and that before unbelievers!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, it is already an utter failure for you that you go to law against one another. Why do you not rather accept wrong? Why do you not rather "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "let yourselves"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " be cheated? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "No, you yourselves do wrong and cheat, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " these things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brethren! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that the unrighteous will not inherit the kingdom of God? Do not be deceived. Neither fornicators, nor idolaters, nor adulterers, nor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "catamites, those submitting to homosexuals"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "homosexuals, nor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "male homosexuals"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sodomites, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nor thieves, nor covetous, nor drunkards, nor revilers, nor extortioners will inherit the kingdom of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And such were some of you. But you were washed, but you were "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "set apart"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sanctified, but you were justified in the name of the Lord Jesus and by the Spirit of our God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Glorify God in Body and Spirit"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All things are lawful for me, but all things are not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "profitable"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "helpful. All things are lawful for me, but I will not be brought under the power of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or anything"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "any. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Foods for the stomach and the stomach for foods, but God will destroy both it and them. Now the body "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not for sexual immorality but for the Lord, and the Lord for the body. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God both raised up the Lord and will also raise us up by His power."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do you not know that your bodies are members of Christ? Shall I then take the members of Christ and make "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " members of a harlot? Certainly not! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or do you not know that he who is joined to a harlot is one body "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "with her?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " For "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“the two,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " He says, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“shall become one flesh.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But he who is joined to the Lord is one spirit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "with Him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Flee sexual immorality. Every sin that a man does is outside the body, but he who commits sexual immorality sins against his own body. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or do you not know that your body is the temple of the Holy Spirit "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in you, whom you have from God, and you are not your own? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you were bought at a price; therefore glorify God in your body "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the rest of v. 20."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and in your spirit, which are God’s."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}